{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.FieldSimp","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Positivity","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.extend_reflection_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.extend_reflection_eq","kind":"theorem","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FiveTwoRogersExtend.lean#L156-L161","doc":"`hrw`-shaped: `L (1 - x) = L1 - L x` for `x ∈ (0,1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.extend_landen_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.extend_landen_eq","kind":"theorem","line":150,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FiveTwoRogersExtend.lean#L150-L154","doc":"`hlan`-shaped: `L x = -L (x/(x-1))` for `x < 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.extend_inv_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.extend_inv_eq","kind":"theorem","line":144,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FiveTwoRogersExtend.lean#L144-L148","doc":"`hinv1`-shaped: `L x = 2·L1 - L (1/x)` for `x > 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.extend_reflection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.extend_reflection","kind":"theorem","line":129,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FiveTwoRogersExtend.lean#L129-L137","doc":"Reflection survives the extension unchanged on `(0,1)`, since both `x` and\n`1 - x` stay in the middle branch. This is what carries\n`FiveTwoRogersReflection.rogersL_reflection` across. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.extend_landen","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.extend_landen","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FiveTwoRogersExtend.lean#L122-L127","doc":"**Landen**, by construction. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.extend_inversion","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.extend_inversion","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FiveTwoRogersExtend.lean#L115-L120","doc":"**Inversion**, by construction. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.landen_mem_unit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.landen_mem_unit","kind":"theorem","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FiveTwoRogersExtend.lean#L103-L113","doc":"Landen lands in the unit interval, for *every* negative `x` — including\n`x < -1`, which is exactly where the power series had nothing to say. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.inv_mem_unit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.inv_mem_unit","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FiveTwoRogersExtend.lean#L98-L101","doc":"Inversion lands in the unit interval: this is why `extend` closes up. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.extend_of_mem","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.extend_of_mem","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FiveTwoRogersExtend.lean#L93-L96","doc":"On `[0,1]` the extension is the original function. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.extend_of_neg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.extend_of_neg","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FiveTwoRogersExtend.lean#L89-L91","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.extend_of_one_lt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.extend_of_one_lt","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FiveTwoRogersExtend.lean#L86-L87","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.extend","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.FiveTwoRogersExtend.extend","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/FiveTwoRogersExtend.lean#L79-L84","doc":"Extend `f`, thought of as defined on `[0,1]`, to all of `ℝ` by the Rogers\nrecipe: inversion above `1`, Landen below `0`. `c` plays the role of `f 1`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}